  "releaseNotes": "Adds the devop-dk .NET 10 global tool with login/logout, permission, inventory, vendor, vendor-invoice, warehouse, company, and webhook commands with explicit mutation safeguards, secure environment-based authentication, live English and Icelandic CLI culture, English-fallback API language negotiation, invoice/order/quote documents and confirmed email delivery, typed resource and generic-table commands, all-level dimension listing, quiet-by-default diagnostics, safe API and parameter-binding errors, table output, and JSON automation output.",
